     Zero is returned if there are no child nodes.

     OOFF__ppaarreenntt() returns the phandle for the parent of the _n_o_d_e.  Zero is re‐
     turned if _n_o_d_e is the root node.

     OOFF__ppeeeerr() returns the phandle value of the next sibling of the _n_o_d_e.
     Zero is returned if there is no sibling node.

